1.0.1

First build that reaches testers. 1.0.0 was uploaded but never assigned to a
testing group, so TestFlight showed nothing new.

- Q-style UI: rounder cards, squishy rating buttons, Mochi the mascot
- Opens straight onto a word card; study as long as you like
- Daily goal is optional

Build 4: distribution now confirms each tester is in the group.
